    <string name="prompt_single_factor_mode_message">Registrations made in passwordless mode let you log in to certain sites without a user name or password.\n\nPasswordless logins stop working once you turn off your screen lock, and cannot be turned on again without a full reset of WearAuthn.\n\nContinue?</string>
